## 2. Material changes since last cycle

Source: https://trust.openai.com (Trust Portal Updates).

1. **ISO/IEC 27001:2022 certified** — announced 2025-08-25. Scope: API, ChatGPT Enterprise, ChatGPT Edu. Includes ISO/IEC 27017:2015 (cloud), 27018:2019 (PII processor), 27701:2019 (PIMS). **Closes the gap explicitly called out in last year's note.**
2. **New SOC 2 Type 2 report** — announced 2025-08-13. Period: 2025-01-01 to 2025-06-30. Scope: API, ChatGPT Enterprise, Edu, Team. Criteria: Security, Availability, Confidentiality, Privacy. Supersedes Dec 2024 report.
3. **PCI DSS v4.0.1** — announced 2026-03-09. Covers ChatGPT delegated payment-processing components.
4. **ISO/IEC 42001:2023** (AI management system) — listed on trust portal. Relevant given Normain's AI-vendor classification of OpenAI.
5. **FedRAMP 20x** documentation now published (low priority for Normain — US gov context).

Full current compliance list: CCPA, CSA STAR, GDPR, ISO 27001/27017/27018/27701, SOC 2, SOC 2 Type 2, SOC 3, TX-RAMP, FedRAMP 20x, ISO 42001:2023, PCI DSS v4.0.1.

No adverse findings or incidents observed in trust portal updates.

